# Web Search AI Agent

## Overview

A simple AI agent built using Python that accepts user queries, generates responses, and stores query history.

## Features

* Accepts user input
* Generates responses
* Stores query history
* Supports scheduled follow-ups

## Technologies Used

* Python
* JSON
* Scheduling

## Files

* agent.py
* scheduler.py

## How to Run

```bash
python agent.py
```

